        "title": "Shipping",
        "content": "<p>We currently only ship within Australia and New Zealand.</p><p>We offer free shipping on all orders over $300 within Australia. All orders are shipped via Australia Post and usually take 3-5 business days to arrive. Please allow 5-8 business days for orders to New Zealand.</p><p>We do offer express shipping at check out as an additional option. This usually takes 1-2 business days. </p><h2>Processing time</h2><p>We aim to ship your order within 1-2 business days from the time we receive it. Please note that some items may have longer processing times which will be indicated in the item description.</p><h2>Delivery times</h2><ul><li>Regular Shipping: 3-7 business days </li><li>Express Shipping: 1-3 business days</li></ul><h2>Order confirmation & Tracking</h2><p>You will receive a confirmation email once your order has been placed, and a shipment confirmation email with your tracking number once your package has been dispatched via Australia Post Express.</p><h2>Pick Up</h2><p>We offer pick up options on request. Please contact us at hello@coppedau.com.au to arrange.</p><h2>Customer support</h2><p>We are always available to support you with any shipping enquiries. If you need to change your shipping details or have any questions, please <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact\">contact us</a>.</p><p>Thank you for choosing Copped AU.</p>",
